== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Accessory
|rarity = epic
|special_effect = Monsters at or below level {{Green|30}} will no longer target you.
}}

While the '''Intimidation Relic''' prevents most monsters at or below {{Level|30}} from attacking the player, a bug causes some mobs to not be affected. These mobs include:

*{{level|15}} {{MobSprite|Minos Hunter}} (probably not a bug)
*{{level|30}} {{MobSprite|Witch's Bat}} (probably not a bug)
*All [[Sea Creatures]] (probably not a bug)

== Trivia ==
*When paired with the [[Parrot Pet]]'s {{AN|Flamboyant}} ability, this accessory can stop Level 45 mobs from attacking you.

